#
# 126720 proprietary id 22 "Set Equalizer" and the matching 130820 message id
# 32795 "Tone" status. Every EQ frame in that capture, 144 commands and 149
# statuses, carries zone 2.
#
# Zone 2 is not a third zone. This unit has two available zones (Capabilities
# 0x001F, 0x0007, 0, 0) and advertises Bass/Mid/Treble only in its global
# capability word (0x01C7). Garmin's Fusion Audio app addresses the global,
# stereo-wide control with a zone equal to the available zone count, here 2.
#
# Selected from a sweep of the Tone controls: ordinary signed values and the
# Treble endpoints +15 (0x0f), 0 and -15 (0xf1). Each command is followed by a
# status carrying the same zone/bass/mid/treble values.
#
# bass 0, mid -4, treble 5
